msgid "How it is shown"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/ajustes.php:297
msgid "The Commission's guidelines illustrate the sentence that opens the notice. Part of the German doctrine reads the law as asking for the whole notice at the checkout, with nothing to click; if you sell in Germany or Austria, or prefer to be on the safe side, choose the whole notice."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/ajustes.php:307
msgid "For the sentence; the whole notice is the Commission's image and has no look of its own."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/ajustes.php:311
#: includes/clases/class-apg-guarantee-help.php:138
msgid "Order email"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/ajustes.php:315
msgid "Include the notice in the customer order emails"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/ajustes.php:317
msgid "The notice goes in as an image, since an email client cannot open a modal. The Commission's guidelines ask for it here too."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/ajustes.php:321
#: includes/clases/class-apg-guarantee-help.php:139
msgid "Only with goods"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/ajustes.php:325
msgid "Leave the notice out of purchases made only of virtual products"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/ajustes.php:327
msgid "The legal guarantee of the notice covers goods. A course, a subscription or a download is not one. Applies to the checkout, the cart, the product page, the order email and the invoice; the floating button, the menu and the footer remind the whole shop and stay where they are."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/ajustes.php:331
#: includes/clases/class-apg-guarantee-help.php:140
msgid "Record on the order"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/ajustes.php:335
msgid "Leave a private note on each order saying what the customer was shown"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/ajustes.php:337
msgid "How and in which language the notice was shown at the checkout, the EU GARAN labels shown, and the first email that carried the official PDF. It is your proof if a customer or an authority ever asks."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/ajustes.php:342
#: includes/clases/class-apg-guarantee-help.php:145
msgid "Product page and cart"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/ajustes.php:343
msgid "Not required: the obligation is met at shop level. They put the notice next to the decision to buy, which is one of the places the Commission's guidelines illustrate."
msgstr ""

